WEBVTT

01:48.440 --> 01:49.720
Hurry, hurry.

01:57.320 --> 01:58.400
Who's here?

01:59.360 --> 02:02.160
Uncle, let's go to the hospital
for a check-up.

02:04.200 --> 02:06.400
He said he was too big

02:06.480 --> 02:07.320
for us to move him.

02:07.400 --> 02:09.160
He insisted on waiting for Chengcheng.

02:10.039 --> 02:12.240
I brought my boyfriend to help.

02:18.200 --> 02:20.640
Uncle, let's go to the hospital first.

02:23.800 --> 02:25.320
You're Gu Yu, right?

02:26.960 --> 02:29.280
Where is Chengcheng?

02:29.360 --> 02:32.840
I've fallen, and she's not even here
to check on me.

02:33.920 --> 02:35.080
Chengcheng, she…

02:36.040 --> 02:37.600
Chengcheng is on her way back.

02:40.880 --> 02:42.560
You're Chengcheng's boss, right?

02:44.760 --> 02:46.320
Tell me.

02:46.400 --> 02:48.040
Where exactly is Su Chengcheng?

02:53.320 --> 02:54.760
Where was Dad hurt?

02:54.840 --> 02:56.800
Why are you standing here?
Why haven't you gone to the hospital?

02:57.480 --> 02:59.200
Why are you the only one who came back?

02:59.280 --> 03:00.720
Didn't Chengcheng contact you?

03:00.800 --> 03:02.800
Uncle insisted on waiting for Chengcheng.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.640
I called an ambulance.

03:06.240 --> 03:08.400
No need. Let's wait for Chengcheng.

03:10.600 --> 03:12.240
Don't call.

03:13.920 --> 03:15.040
Your dad's fine.

03:15.600 --> 03:18.120
He's just upset
that Chengcheng lied to us.

03:18.720 --> 03:20.000
Your dad wants to see her.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.440
Su Chengcheng, Tang Qi,

03:27.280 --> 03:28.800
and you, Lin Yuan,

03:28.880 --> 03:30.000
including Gu Yu.

03:30.760 --> 03:32.320
You all told me

03:32.880 --> 03:34.240
that Chengcheng was on a business trip.

03:34.320 --> 03:36.200
But two hours ago,

03:36.280 --> 03:37.440
Chengcheng's colleague came here

03:37.520 --> 03:39.320
and said she hadn't been
on any business trip.

03:39.400 --> 03:40.840
She just took sick leave.

03:43.040 --> 03:45.280
You were all just fooling me.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.560
She's not at home

03:46.640 --> 03:47.760
and not at work.

03:47.840 --> 03:49.360
Where has she gone?

03:56.880 --> 03:57.720
Come out.

04:04.120 --> 04:08.080
FORTUNE

04:09.000 --> 04:09.840
Uncle, Aunt.

04:10.760 --> 04:12.320
As soon as Chengcheng got the news,

04:12.400 --> 04:13.600
she told me to come here at once.

04:19.640 --> 04:20.640
What's with you?

04:20.720 --> 04:23.120
Why are you dressed like this?

04:23.680 --> 04:24.920
Take off that outfit.

04:25.760 --> 04:27.160
I won't scold you.

04:30.640 --> 04:32.520
Dad, Mom.

04:36.080 --> 04:37.520
There's something

04:39.160 --> 04:40.360
I need to tell you.

05:03.840 --> 05:08.560
Chengcheng got a filter
that can change her appearance,

05:11.120 --> 05:13.440
but it's made her invisible now?

05:17.040 --> 05:20.040
Chengcheng is inside this doll,

05:20.120 --> 05:21.920
but without her outer clothes,

05:22.000 --> 05:23.280
we can't see her?

05:25.240 --> 05:26.080
Yes.

05:29.200 --> 05:31.760
Whatever she looks like,
she's still my daughter.

05:33.160 --> 05:34.520
It's okay, Chengcheng.

05:34.600 --> 05:36.280
Let me see you.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.200
Chengcheng…

06:10.280 --> 06:11.240
Chengcheng.

06:27.080 --> 06:28.160
Mom.

06:30.520 --> 06:31.440
- Dad.
- Chengcheng.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.440
Don't be afraid.

06:36.440 --> 06:37.560
We'll find a way.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.240
There must be a way to solve it.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.760
Dad, Mom.

06:50.520 --> 06:52.760
The filter blocked Chengcheng's voice.

06:53.600 --> 06:57.360
She can only communicate
by WeChat or by writing.

06:57.440 --> 06:59.200
If you keep holding her like this,

07:00.960 --> 07:04.160
she won't be able to say anything.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.480
Sit down first.

07:44.800 --> 07:45.720
Chengcheng.

07:47.960 --> 07:49.800
Tell us whatever you want to say.

07:50.760 --> 07:51.680
You can write it down.

08:04.320 --> 08:06.280
Dad, Mom.

08:07.240 --> 08:10.560
I'm sorry. I've made you worry.

08:16.600 --> 08:17.680
It's okay.

08:19.960 --> 08:20.880
Don't be afraid.

08:24.760 --> 08:26.800
How could this happen?

08:42.520 --> 08:45.760
I've been reflecting on this these days.

08:46.600 --> 08:48.840
The filter has always been unstable,

08:48.920 --> 08:50.800
but why do I only

08:51.640 --> 08:53.400
want to take off the filter today,

08:53.920 --> 08:56.200
when no one can see me?

08:57.240 --> 08:58.560
When everyone

08:59.120 --> 09:01.400
could still see me,

09:02.040 --> 09:04.040
why didn't I make up my mind
to take it off?

09:05.440 --> 09:07.520
Even though I knew it wasn't right,

09:08.040 --> 09:10.080
why did I keep using the filter

09:10.760 --> 09:12.040
and letting it upgrade each time?

09:12.120 --> 09:13.800
Everything with you is wrong.

09:13.880 --> 09:15.200
What more do we need to ask you?

09:16.560 --> 09:18.200
Don't delay our next interview.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.880
Su Chengcheng, we know the result now.

09:22.960 --> 09:24.360
You can go home now.

09:25.520 --> 09:26.680
Ladies first.

09:26.760 --> 09:27.760
Thank you.

09:32.320 --> 09:34.280
I pretended not to care,

09:35.040 --> 09:35.880
but in reality,

09:36.720 --> 09:38.960
I've always been dissatisfied
with my appearance.

09:40.440 --> 09:43.040
I wanted to look like other pretty girls,

09:43.560 --> 09:45.520
not be ignored by anyone,

09:46.120 --> 09:48.640
and gain the affection and respect
of people my age.

09:51.440 --> 09:53.800
Because of my anxiety about my appearance,

09:54.840 --> 09:56.400
I could never give up the filter,

09:57.960 --> 09:59.600
which led to today's outcome.

10:01.240 --> 10:03.080
The filter kept upgrading,

10:03.920 --> 10:06.040
slowly devouring my true self.

10:07.480 --> 10:09.080
Now, no one can see me.

10:16.160 --> 10:17.600
It's us who have failed you.

10:19.160 --> 10:22.320
Though we've always said
we didn't care about your looks,

10:24.040 --> 10:29.040
we've always thought
you didn't look as good as your sister,

10:29.720 --> 10:31.320
and it'd be hard for you to get married.

10:31.400 --> 10:34.000
But we didn't mean any harm.

10:34.600 --> 10:36.040
It was all for your good.

10:38.920 --> 10:42.760
But we didn't expect this good intention

10:43.600 --> 10:45.440
to put a lot of pressure on you.

10:46.800 --> 10:47.960
Qingli.

10:48.040 --> 10:50.440
Introduce a boyfriend to Chengcheng.

10:50.520 --> 10:53.280
Your sister hasn't even had a crush

10:53.360 --> 10:55.320
since she was little.

11:16.400 --> 11:20.280
I know you worry about me
because you love me.

11:22.120 --> 11:24.200
I've never blamed you.

11:24.280 --> 11:26.160
Did the interviewer criticize

11:26.240 --> 11:27.800
the photo I edited for you?

11:27.880 --> 11:29.760
Isn't this outfit too eye-catching?

11:30.560 --> 11:33.160
Do you think others won't dress up?

11:33.240 --> 11:34.440
Everyone will dress up

11:34.520 --> 11:36.160
to save face, spending all they have.

11:36.240 --> 11:38.200
Are these skirt pants too short?

11:38.280 --> 11:40.000
This is called healthy.

11:40.080 --> 11:42.400
Looking like a stick isn't beautiful.

11:42.480 --> 11:43.480
That's sickly.

11:44.760 --> 11:45.600
Chengcheng,

11:45.680 --> 11:48.520
I've always comforted you
not to care about appearance

11:49.160 --> 11:51.360
and sometimes purposely
looked unattractive

11:51.440 --> 11:53.360
to show that I'm in this with you.

11:53.960 --> 11:56.760
But if I didn't think appearance mattered,

11:56.840 --> 11:58.760
why would I do such things?

11:59.440 --> 12:02.560
I'm also one of those
who created appearance anxiety for you.

12:02.640 --> 12:04.200
Sorry.

12:14.560 --> 12:15.680
During interviews,

12:16.720 --> 12:18.360
I have judged people based on their looks.

12:19.600 --> 12:20.520
Sorry.

12:20.600 --> 12:22.880
Beauty products sell beauty.

12:22.960 --> 12:24.440
I hope the Marketing Department staff

12:24.520 --> 12:25.520
can not only work hard

12:25.600 --> 12:26.960
but also have a good appearance,

12:27.040 --> 12:29.440
so they can be persuasive
when meeting clients.

12:34.200 --> 12:35.720
I'll return to the palace.

12:35.800 --> 12:38.520
Goodbye, Your Highness.

12:39.600 --> 12:40.920
As my sister,

12:41.640 --> 12:42.960
you've carried a lot of pressure

12:44.000 --> 12:46.760
regarding appearance
since you were little.

12:48.120 --> 12:50.640
Don't just dress up your doll
and do makeup for it.

12:50.720 --> 12:53.160
You should put on makeup and dress up too.

12:53.240 --> 12:54.560
Look at you,

12:54.640 --> 12:56.320
not even bothering to tidy yourself up.

12:56.400 --> 12:57.920
Your face is oily enough to fry food.

12:58.440 --> 13:00.120
Since you're at home unemployed,

13:00.200 --> 13:02.240
you should study how to dress up.

13:02.320 --> 13:03.480
Dress yourself up.

13:03.560 --> 13:06.480
It's fine if you can't find a man,

13:06.560 --> 13:08.160
but it's deadly if you can't find a job.

13:09.120 --> 13:11.320
Being pretty isn't my fault,

13:13.160 --> 13:15.120
so I don't want to say sorry.

13:17.600 --> 13:18.640
But…

13:28.440 --> 13:29.360
Sorry.

13:46.920 --> 13:48.800
Don't be upset or feel guilty.

13:49.440 --> 13:52.920
It's me who wasn't confident
or brave enough.

13:54.760 --> 13:56.400
Now, I understand

13:56.480 --> 13:58.280
I can change how others see me.

13:59.040 --> 14:00.480
I really like the person I am now.

14:33.080 --> 14:33.920
Chengcheng.

14:35.360 --> 14:36.400
Mom.

14:37.320 --> 14:38.240
Chengcheng.

14:42.160 --> 14:43.000
Dad.

14:47.600 --> 14:49.520
Uncle, Aunt.

14:50.480 --> 14:52.240
Chengcheng is not alone this time.

14:52.920 --> 14:53.840
We're in this together.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.400
We'll definitely find a way
to remove the filter.

15:12.800 --> 15:15.760
DON'T LOSE YOUR HAPPINESS
TO UNIMPORTANT PEOPLE

15:29.520 --> 15:31.800
Chengcheng, let's sleep together tonight.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.720
You must be hungry.

15:37.800 --> 15:38.920
I made some late-night snacks for you.

15:45.720 --> 15:46.720
It's here.

15:47.800 --> 15:49.560
The gloves are for Chengcheng.

15:53.600 --> 15:55.880
Thank you. I'm thanking you on her behalf.

15:55.960 --> 15:57.840
No. Chengcheng would say,

15:57.920 --> 15:59.920
"Thank you, my dear mom."

16:05.440 --> 16:06.280
So childish.

16:06.360 --> 16:07.640
Alright, eat then.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.000
If it's not enough, I'll make more.

16:09.680 --> 16:10.520
It's enough.

16:10.600 --> 16:12.040
They can't eat too much at night.

16:12.120 --> 16:13.200
It's bad for digestion.

16:13.280 --> 16:14.200
Right.

16:14.280 --> 16:15.280
Eat then.

16:28.800 --> 16:31.280
Congrats to Su Chengcheng
for finding someone.

16:34.720 --> 16:36.000
Thank you.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.000
With you all here,

16:37.080 --> 16:38.960
even if I'm invisible forever,

16:39.040 --> 16:40.160
I won't be afraid.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.680
Can't you drink?

16:49.160 --> 16:50.720
Chengcheng must be moved

16:50.800 --> 16:53.240
to have such a good friend like me
and such a beautiful sister

16:55.000 --> 16:55.960
like you.

17:01.640 --> 17:04.359
Tonight, I'll sleep in my room.

17:17.359 --> 17:18.920
Let's eat, everyone.

17:19.520 --> 17:21.400
Time to eat.

17:22.520 --> 17:24.040
Wear the gloves to eat.

17:24.119 --> 17:25.079
I don't want to.

17:30.920 --> 17:32.200
MY MOM

17:32.280 --> 17:34.640
My mom is invisible.

17:34.720 --> 17:38.360
No one can see her or hear her.

17:38.440 --> 17:40.600
Every time our family goes on a trip,

17:40.680 --> 17:43.400
everyone can only see me and Dad,

17:43.480 --> 17:47.480
but I know Mom has always been with us.

17:47.560 --> 17:49.040
She loves me and Dad so much.

17:49.120 --> 17:51.000
She often performs magic for me.

17:51.080 --> 17:53.320
Tang Yuwen, you're lying.
You don't have a mom.

17:53.400 --> 17:56.480
Yeah, you're lying. You don't have a mom.

17:56.560 --> 17:58.200
- You're lying to us.
- I have a mom.

17:58.280 --> 18:00.120
You don't have a mom.

18:00.200 --> 18:01.840
- Tang Yuwen, you're lying.
- I do.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.560
You don't have a mom.

18:03.640 --> 18:05.160
You're lying.

18:05.240 --> 18:08.720
- You don't have a mom.
- I have a mom!

18:28.880 --> 18:31.000
A bunch of stupid kids.

18:33.440 --> 18:35.640
Tang Yuwen?

18:37.760 --> 18:39.640
My son is a Tang?

18:41.680 --> 18:44.320
I married Tang Qi?

18:55.560 --> 18:58.960
If I'm trapped by this filter
and remain invisible…

18:59.040 --> 18:59.880
TANG QI

18:59.960 --> 19:02.680
…can you really accept
an invisible girlfriend?

19:05.040 --> 19:07.480
Are you anxious
about your appearance again?

19:08.440 --> 19:10.720
I'm talking about being invisible.

19:10.800 --> 19:13.640
That's different
from thinking I'm not pretty.

19:32.840 --> 19:35.360
I guess this is the benefit
of being invisible.

19:39.480 --> 19:42.200
Miss Su, may I ask if you're free today?

19:44.680 --> 19:46.480
What could I possibly be busy with?

19:50.200 --> 19:51.120
I'm free.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.080
TANG QI

19:52.160 --> 19:53.160
Half an hour later,

19:53.240 --> 19:54.560
I'll pick you up downstairs.

19:58.360 --> 19:59.360
Let's have a date.

20:04.560 --> 20:05.640
OK.

20:16.120 --> 20:17.040
Keep walking.

20:26.920 --> 20:28.760
I had a dream last night.

20:28.840 --> 20:31.080
I dreamed our son
was in elementary school.

20:31.160 --> 20:32.800
Do you know what our son's name is?

20:32.880 --> 20:34.600
He's called Tang Yuwen Chinese.

20:34.680 --> 20:36.560
Why isn't he called Tang Tiyu Sports?

20:37.360 --> 20:38.520
What are you talking about?

20:39.160 --> 20:40.520
How did you know I was speaking?

20:40.600 --> 20:42.320
Your facial muscles were moving.

20:46.160 --> 20:47.760
Come on. Let's keep walking.

20:49.240 --> 20:50.920
OK, slow down.

20:55.960 --> 20:56.800
We're here.

21:18.800 --> 21:22.240
For me, this is a special place.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.280
The first time I waited joyfully

21:27.000 --> 21:28.280
for the girl I liked.

21:30.760 --> 21:32.320
The first time I felt heartbroken

21:34.680 --> 21:36.120
for losing the girl I liked.

22:11.120 --> 22:12.360
Su Miao!

22:32.440 --> 22:33.520
Sorry.

22:42.160 --> 22:43.640
I thought my vision was fine,

22:45.920 --> 22:47.920
but I always ignored you.

23:01.280 --> 23:02.480
This is something I made.

23:10.760 --> 23:11.880
What is this?

23:12.480 --> 23:15.200
When molten glass drips into cold water,

23:15.800 --> 23:17.240
it'll solidify into a droplet

23:17.320 --> 23:18.960
under gravity.

23:19.840 --> 23:22.120
Named after the discoverer,

23:23.800 --> 23:25.120
it's called Prince Rupert's drops.

23:46.680 --> 23:49.480
It may seem simple in shape,

23:50.120 --> 23:52.520
but its structure is special.
It's extremely hard.

23:53.120 --> 23:55.040
Even when subjected
to eight tons of pressure

23:55.120 --> 23:57.080
or shot with a bullet, it won't break.

23:58.040 --> 24:00.360
It must be the hardest glass in the world.

24:02.880 --> 24:05.240
It can withstand eight tons of pressure,

24:05.320 --> 24:06.560
and even bullets can't shatter it.

24:07.920 --> 24:11.000
But if you pinch its critical point,

24:11.080 --> 24:12.360
that is, this little tail…

24:14.000 --> 24:16.200
You just need to pinch it a little hard,

24:25.360 --> 24:26.720
and the whole drop

24:26.800 --> 24:29.240
will shatter into pieces instantly

24:29.320 --> 24:30.320
and completely crushed.

24:30.920 --> 24:34.000
As it is both incredibly hard and fragile,

24:34.080 --> 24:36.960
Westerners often consider it

24:37.040 --> 24:38.880
as a symbol of love.

24:42.400 --> 24:44.720
This is the love you made then.

24:45.840 --> 24:47.160
I will accept it.

24:49.440 --> 24:51.840
Carry it with you when you go out.

24:53.040 --> 24:54.080
Others can't see it,

24:54.720 --> 24:56.560
but when you have an emergency,

24:56.640 --> 24:58.720
you can pinch its tail.

25:00.800 --> 25:02.160
No matter where you are,

25:04.200 --> 25:05.440
I will be able to find you.

25:06.840 --> 25:08.680
Your dad, mom, sister,

25:09.760 --> 25:10.680
and Lin Yuan

25:12.800 --> 25:13.960
will also be able to find you.

25:43.680 --> 25:44.600
This time,

25:48.280 --> 25:49.880
I'll never lose sight of you again.

25:58.280 --> 25:59.120
Su Chengcheng,

26:02.240 --> 26:03.400
will you marry me?

26:05.520 --> 26:07.000
Even if I can't see you

26:08.360 --> 26:12.160
and kiss the wrong place…

26:13.680 --> 26:15.080
Even if I can't hear you

26:17.400 --> 26:19.080
and won't be able to respond

26:21.080 --> 26:22.080
when you cry for help…

26:36.880 --> 26:37.720
Yes.

26:41.320 --> 26:43.480
Even if I can't hear you

26:45.920 --> 26:46.960
say yes…

26:50.520 --> 26:51.440
Sorry.

26:53.840 --> 26:55.480
This is your first proposal,

26:57.360 --> 26:59.800
but I can't let you hear me.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.520
Then I'll

27:05.920 --> 27:07.640
let you feel it.

27:43.080 --> 27:45.360
Yuan always talks about you guys.

27:45.440 --> 27:46.480
I should've come earlier,

27:46.560 --> 27:48.360
but I only paid
my first official visit today.

27:48.440 --> 27:50.240
- It's my fault.
- It's okay.

27:50.320 --> 27:52.880
We originally wanted
to wait for Chengcheng,

27:52.960 --> 27:55.120
but she suddenly…

27:57.200 --> 27:58.800
So, we couldn't manage it.

27:58.880 --> 28:00.400
Aunt, Uncle, don't worry.

28:00.480 --> 28:02.720
Tang is contacting the lab in Beijing.

28:02.800 --> 28:04.240
With professional cutting tools,

28:04.320 --> 28:05.320
they will definitely remove the filter.

28:06.120 --> 28:07.560
- Really?
- Yes.

28:08.080 --> 28:09.280
But it's special,

28:09.360 --> 28:11.560
so Tang said it'd take some time
to arrange.

28:13.520 --> 28:14.760
Those high-end experts

28:14.840 --> 28:16.800
can even send such a big thing to Mars.

28:16.880 --> 28:19.480
Surely, they can remove a bracelet.
Don't worry.

28:21.120 --> 28:22.200
That's great.

28:22.760 --> 28:24.160
Tang

28:24.240 --> 28:25.920
is a reliable young man.

28:28.840 --> 28:30.240
By the way,

28:30.320 --> 28:32.280
I have a friend from the Qin Mountains.

28:32.360 --> 28:33.640
I asked him to buy some local specialties

28:33.720 --> 28:34.840
from his fellow villagers.

28:35.400 --> 28:36.720
This is…

28:36.800 --> 28:39.080
Ferns. So tender.

28:39.960 --> 28:42.080
You can't find such tender ferns outside.

28:42.160 --> 28:43.800
- Yeah.
- Good stuff.

28:45.280 --> 28:46.200
This is…

28:46.840 --> 28:47.960
I know this one too.

28:48.040 --> 28:50.440
Walnut flowers,
also called longevity vegetables.

28:50.520 --> 28:52.080
We haven't had this in years.

28:52.160 --> 28:54.720
Hurry.
Go to the kitchen and soak it in water.

28:54.800 --> 28:56.160
We'll stir-fry it tonight.

28:56.240 --> 28:57.960
Alright, you chat.

28:58.040 --> 28:59.080
I'll go soak it.

28:59.160 --> 29:00.200
Alright.

29:00.920 --> 29:02.520
These are wild mushrooms
from the mountains.

29:02.600 --> 29:04.440
They just dried whatever they picked.

29:04.520 --> 29:05.800
There are all sorts of mushrooms.

29:06.400 --> 29:09.400
Smells so good.
I just bought a chicken this morning.

29:09.480 --> 29:12.280
We can make a mushroom stew
with chicken tonight.

29:15.120 --> 29:16.120
These are ginkgo nuts.

29:16.200 --> 29:17.200
Ginkgo nuts.

29:17.880 --> 29:20.200
I've been watching a show lately
where they eat these.

29:21.000 --> 29:22.080
I'll cook them for you tonight.

29:22.160 --> 29:24.200
I promise they'll taste better

29:24.280 --> 29:25.840
- than what you saw in the show.
- Alright.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.400
These are Chinese hickories
that my friend grows.

29:29.480 --> 29:32.120
Yuan, take these to your aunt.

29:32.200 --> 29:33.960
Help her clean up.

29:34.040 --> 29:35.600
Some things are sensitive to moisture,

29:35.680 --> 29:36.960
so package them up.

29:37.680 --> 29:39.080
I'll help you.

29:39.160 --> 29:40.320
Leave the walnuts.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.560
Sit down and drink tea.

29:56.200 --> 29:57.040
Drink some tea.

30:01.880 --> 30:03.000
Walnuts.

30:20.080 --> 30:22.760
I lost control and used too much strength.

30:26.680 --> 30:27.760
Gu,

30:29.440 --> 30:33.440
Yuan's last name is Lin,

30:33.520 --> 30:35.040
not Su, like me,

30:35.560 --> 30:36.880
but your aunt and I

30:36.960 --> 30:38.560
have watched her grow up.

30:39.400 --> 30:43.560
To us, she's like Chengcheng and Qingli.

30:44.440 --> 30:47.600
She suffered a lot when she was little.

30:49.160 --> 30:53.720
If you're dating, date seriously.

30:54.760 --> 30:57.160
Even if things don't work out one day,

30:57.240 --> 30:58.840
just be honest about it.

30:59.800 --> 31:03.520
If there's anything sneaky,
making things complicated,

31:05.040 --> 31:07.720
I'll be angry.

31:18.560 --> 31:21.000
Don't worry, Uncle. I'll remember that.

31:23.000 --> 31:24.000
Good.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.760
Have some tea and walnuts.

31:33.760 --> 31:38.320
Sometimes, women don't need to know

31:38.400 --> 31:40.000
some things men have discussed.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.360
Yuan won't know.

31:44.400 --> 31:46.000
Eat. Try it.

31:49.120 --> 31:51.400
Are these walnuts easy to crack?

31:53.360 --> 31:54.400
It takes skill.

31:57.040 --> 31:58.320
Decades of skill.

32:08.840 --> 32:10.640
Give this to Chengcheng.
Give her more of this.

32:10.720 --> 32:12.000
- Is it good?
- Yes.

32:12.520 --> 32:13.520
You eat it.

32:13.600 --> 32:14.960
Mom, I don't want it.
Please don't add more.

32:15.040 --> 32:16.080
You eat it.

32:16.640 --> 32:17.480
Just eat.

32:21.160 --> 32:23.000
Cheers, everyone.

32:23.840 --> 32:24.960
Come on.

32:25.040 --> 32:28.240
Welcome Tang and Gu
to our home for dinner.

32:29.760 --> 32:31.640
Is Chengcheng still here?

32:33.800 --> 32:34.960
Eat more.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.000
Come on.

32:37.080 --> 32:38.000
Come on.

32:39.000 --> 32:40.240
Eat more. Okay?

32:40.320 --> 32:41.280
Come on, cheers.

32:49.240 --> 32:51.360
Thank you, Uncle, Aunt,
for preparing so many goodies for us.

32:51.960 --> 32:52.880
No wonder Yuan always says

32:52.960 --> 32:54.800
that the food outside is never
as good as what you make.

32:56.480 --> 32:57.480
Alright.

32:58.160 --> 32:59.480
Thank you, Uncle, Aunt.

33:00.520 --> 33:01.440
It's fine.

33:01.520 --> 33:03.160
Don't be so polite. Eat more.

33:03.240 --> 33:04.240
OK.

33:04.320 --> 33:05.960
Tang Qi, you should just

33:06.040 --> 33:07.680
copy whatever Gu Yu says

33:07.760 --> 33:09.920
in the future,
and you won't make any mistakes.

33:11.960 --> 33:13.760
Uncle, I'll toast to you again.

33:13.840 --> 33:14.960
Alright.

33:15.640 --> 33:17.000
Uncle,

33:18.240 --> 33:19.120
cheers.

33:21.160 --> 33:22.200
- Let's drink together.
- Come on!

33:23.000 --> 33:23.960
What did I just say?

33:28.920 --> 33:29.880
Eat this.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.160
Thank you, Aunt.

33:31.240 --> 33:33.080
- Try it.
- Everyone, try it.

33:44.720 --> 33:46.320
Here, have some of this.

33:47.640 --> 33:48.840
The dried tofu is delicious.

33:49.360 --> 33:50.560
I love you all.

34:00.680 --> 34:01.560
Not mine.

34:02.240 --> 34:03.400
It's not mine either.

34:07.280 --> 34:08.320
Chengcheng?

34:18.000 --> 34:18.960
I didn't bring it.

34:27.239 --> 34:28.120
Chengcheng.

34:29.679 --> 34:30.719
Is it the filter?

34:51.440 --> 34:57.880
ANSWER

35:05.120 --> 35:06.080
Hello?

35:07.960 --> 35:09.720
Don't you like the filter?

35:11.080 --> 35:12.480
No.

35:13.400 --> 35:15.560
Don't you like doing whatever you like

35:15.640 --> 35:18.440
and become more beautiful and charming?

35:20.600 --> 35:21.680
I do,

35:23.360 --> 35:25.400
but I like being myself more.

35:27.560 --> 35:28.840
My friends,

35:30.480 --> 35:31.640
my boyfriend,

35:33.400 --> 35:35.320
my parents, and my sister…

35:37.440 --> 35:39.280
They like me,

35:40.840 --> 35:42.320
not Su Miao,

35:43.400 --> 35:45.320
Fang Jin,

35:45.400 --> 35:47.440
or Quan Shengtang.

35:49.080 --> 35:51.040
I just want to be myself.

35:53.280 --> 35:55.560
See you tomorrow night at the same place.

36:44.640 --> 36:45.600
Don't be nervous.

36:46.160 --> 36:47.520
Since she contacted you,

36:48.480 --> 36:49.920
she must be willing to solve it too.

37:05.360 --> 37:07.240
That stuff there is really great.

37:07.320 --> 37:09.120
- Really?
- I'll take you there next time.

37:09.200 --> 37:10.280
Great.

37:11.080 --> 37:12.240
Are we almost there?

37:12.840 --> 37:13.880
Yes, almost.

37:17.120 --> 37:18.160
- Sorry, miss.
- Sorry, miss.

37:19.320 --> 37:21.040
How could you be so careless?

37:21.120 --> 37:22.720
I wasn't paying attention.

37:22.800 --> 37:24.080
She can see me.

37:26.040 --> 37:27.200
I can see you too.

37:28.240 --> 37:29.600
You can see me too?

37:39.840 --> 37:41.320
Can you see her? This is my girlfriend.

37:41.400 --> 37:42.600
- Yes.
- My girlfriend.

37:42.680 --> 37:44.200
Can you see her? This is my girlfriend.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.080
- How pretty.
- This is my girlfriend.

37:46.160 --> 37:47.240
See? This is my girlfriend.

37:47.320 --> 37:48.720
Yes. She's really pretty.

37:48.800 --> 37:51.120
Yes, we all saw her.

37:54.320 --> 37:55.760
Your girlfriend.

38:04.480 --> 38:05.400
Granny.

38:06.280 --> 38:09.640
Seems like you really like
the way you are now.

38:13.600 --> 38:16.520
Thank you for participating
in our filter experiment.

38:18.120 --> 38:20.600
This filter is for you.

38:22.320 --> 38:23.520
I don't want it.

38:23.600 --> 38:25.760
I just want to stay true to myself.

38:29.400 --> 38:32.040
This filter is powerful,

38:32.120 --> 38:33.560
especially after this test.

38:34.480 --> 38:36.240
It will be even more stable.

38:38.240 --> 38:39.400
Are you really willing to give it up?

38:44.960 --> 38:47.040
I just want to be my true self

38:47.120 --> 38:48.560
every day of my future.

38:58.600 --> 38:59.760
Then, give it back to me.

39:32.680 --> 39:33.520
Goodbye.

39:34.120 --> 39:34.960
Goodbye.

39:44.560 --> 39:46.440
Granny, who are you?

39:47.640 --> 39:49.000
Goodbye.

39:59.640 --> 40:01.840
Your girlfriend no longer
has special powers.

40:02.400 --> 40:04.240
Now, she's an ordinary girl.

40:07.520 --> 40:08.480
I can rest easy now.

40:29.880 --> 40:32.440
In the past, scientists thought
chameleons changed color

40:32.520 --> 40:34.000
because of pigment cells in their bodies,

40:34.920 --> 40:38.160
but recently, it's been discovered
that chameleons have a layer

40:38.240 --> 40:39.800
of nanocrystals on their skin.

40:39.880 --> 40:41.760
So, they change color

40:41.840 --> 40:43.040
by adjusting the nanocrystals

40:43.120 --> 40:45.320
to alter the light's refraction.

40:50.280 --> 40:51.360
Qingli,

40:51.440 --> 40:54.600
aren't you curious why it doesn't change
to a color like a rock?

40:59.120 --> 41:00.120
I'm curious.

41:01.920 --> 41:04.280
Go ahead. Tell me why.

41:08.000 --> 41:09.840
When chameleons want to avoid predators

41:09.920 --> 41:11.600
or chase prey,

41:11.680 --> 41:14.680
they change their colors to blend
with their surroundings.

41:14.760 --> 41:16.040
But most of the time,

41:16.120 --> 41:18.160
chameleons change their colors
to send messages.

41:18.240 --> 41:20.840
Since they can't hear or smell,

41:20.920 --> 41:23.280
they rely on their colors

41:23.360 --> 41:24.320
to communicate with their kind.

41:24.400 --> 41:25.360
For example,

41:26.640 --> 41:27.880
when other animals

41:27.960 --> 41:29.320
enter their territory,

41:29.400 --> 41:30.920
they turn to bright colors

41:31.000 --> 41:33.680
like red or yellow

41:33.760 --> 41:35.120
to warn them.

41:39.080 --> 41:40.360
Just now, it was anxious,

41:40.440 --> 41:41.680
treating us as enemies,

41:41.760 --> 41:44.440
so it changed colors so often,

41:44.520 --> 41:46.040
trying to hide itself.

41:46.120 --> 41:47.880
To protect its territory,

41:47.960 --> 41:50.200
it had no choice
but to turn bright to scare us.

41:53.280 --> 41:55.440
Don't be scared. We're friends,

41:55.520 --> 41:56.720
not enemies.

42:00.840 --> 42:03.240
Is this the gift you want
to give to Chengcheng?

42:09.640 --> 42:11.640
Don't you think it looks like a girl?

42:12.240 --> 42:13.760
Sometimes, it disguises itself

42:13.840 --> 42:15.400
and pretends to be flashy,

42:16.000 --> 42:19.000
only to cover up its insecurity
and encourage itself to be confident.

42:19.720 --> 42:21.480
Sometimes, it disguises itself

42:21.560 --> 42:24.040
to fit in like everyone else,

42:24.120 --> 42:25.440
instead of being eliminated by nature.

42:33.280 --> 42:34.680
It's indeed like a girl.

42:36.400 --> 42:38.720
I just want Chengcheng to see

42:38.800 --> 42:40.160
that the world is full of diversity,

42:40.240 --> 42:41.160
and she's not the only one who can change.

42:41.760 --> 42:43.040
Even if she can't take the filter off,

42:43.120 --> 42:45.680
she can still live vibrantly,
like a chameleon.

42:48.600 --> 42:50.440
How considerate of you.

42:51.680 --> 42:52.760
See?

42:52.840 --> 42:54.760
I told you Qingli and Chengcheng
would love it.

43:19.080 --> 43:20.000
Let me check the time.

43:21.280 --> 43:22.520
It's not what I'm thinking.

43:23.520 --> 43:24.880
I want to send Chengcheng a message.

43:28.600 --> 43:29.880
Don't worry.

43:29.960 --> 43:31.480
We've found the old lady.

43:31.560 --> 43:33.240
There must be a solution.

43:37.000 --> 43:38.080
The door has opened.

43:40.200 --> 43:41.200
She's back?

43:42.240 --> 43:43.160
Chengcheng's back?

43:43.240 --> 43:44.320
Uncle, Aunt.

44:14.400 --> 44:15.440
You must be hungry.

44:16.880 --> 44:17.960
Let's get the rice.

44:18.920 --> 44:21.520
I'm stir-frying some vegetables.

44:21.600 --> 44:22.920
Get ready to eat.

44:26.720 --> 44:28.000
Dad, Mom.

44:30.320 --> 44:31.480
Chengcheng!

44:33.080 --> 44:34.800
I'm back to normal.

44:35.560 --> 44:37.080
My goodness!

44:37.160 --> 44:40.000
- We can finally see and touch you.
- Dad.

44:42.120 --> 44:44.120
- You bad girl.
- Mom.

44:44.200 --> 44:45.160
It took so long.

44:45.240 --> 44:48.800
- Sorry for worrying you.
- Let me take a look.

44:49.600 --> 44:52.200
You bad girl, how dare you scare us!

44:52.280 --> 44:54.320
If it happens again,
I'll really deal with you.

44:54.400 --> 44:56.640
Mom, Su Qingli is threatening me.

44:56.720 --> 44:58.000
Such a tattletale.

44:58.600 --> 44:59.800
Alright.

44:59.880 --> 45:00.960
Go serve the dishes.

45:01.040 --> 45:02.240
Be helpful, okay?

45:07.640 --> 45:09.120
I'll go grab the cutlery.

45:10.640 --> 45:11.640
And you.

45:11.720 --> 45:14.240
Take off this clumsy and annoying thing.

45:14.320 --> 45:15.480
You look like a big bear.

45:15.560 --> 45:17.600
Su, hurry up. They're hungry.

45:17.680 --> 45:18.800
Alright, alright.

45:22.880 --> 45:25.080
Uncle, how about I make the last dish?

45:25.160 --> 45:26.400
I'd love to show you my cooking.

45:26.480 --> 45:27.440
Yes, yes.

45:32.880 --> 45:34.840
No need, you're guests.

45:34.920 --> 45:36.920
- I'll do it.
- Alright.

45:37.000 --> 45:39.040
Just bring out the dining table.

45:45.240 --> 45:47.440
Mr. Gu, you're really capable.

45:48.040 --> 45:49.960
Not at all.
It's all thanks to my weak peer.

45:53.520 --> 45:54.880
Try harder.
